<title>JAPAN: Ishii Precision -6mth parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Ishii Precision -6mth parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    PREVIOUS	   ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	   FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		793    million	 830    million	 761    million</p>
<p> Current	   prft 24 million   loss 10    million  loss 144    million</p>
<p> Net		 prft 51 million	prft 20 million  loss 146    million</p>
<p>NOTE - Ishii Precision Tool Co Ltd is a maker of super-hard tools, such as turbine cutters.</p>
